        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create, explore, and share adventures in a unique puzzle-like multiverse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is both an <strong>adventure builder</strong> and a <strong>puzzle-exploration quest</strong>. It combines gameplay with creation tools, letting players design their own interconnected worlds and share them with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What’s in the game right now (Early Access):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest exploration</strong>: Travel through a multi-connected space where every passage leads to new rooms, challenges, and discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room editor</strong>: Place and arrange rooms on a 2D slice of multidimensional space. Customize how rooms connect through passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickable items</strong>: Add objects that can be collected and interacted with during gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPCs</strong>: Place simple characters, adjust their poses, and create dialogue trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Event triggers</strong>: Define conditions that react to player actions and change the world state (e.g. opening doors, unlocking puzzles, or changing NPC behavior).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom assets</strong>: Upload your own .glb models to create new items or decorations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloud sharing</strong>: Publish your levels to the cloud, browse creations from other players, and download them directly in-game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features as the project grows:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More puzzle mechanics and interactive objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded NPC behaviors, quests, and character progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful customization tools for creating complete story-driven adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community hub for sharing, rating, and improving player-made content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your imagination is the main resource. Build connected spaces, design puzzles, create stories, and share them with others. If you enjoy <strong>creative freedom, puzzle-like exploration, and building games together with a community</strong>, this project is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in Early Access and help shape the future of the adventure builder.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create, explore, and share adventures in a unique puzzle-like multiverse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is both an <strong>adventure builder</strong> and a <strong>puzzle-exploration quest</strong>. It combines gameplay with creation tools, letting players design their own interconnected worlds and share them with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What’s in the game right now (Early Access):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest exploration</strong>: Travel through a multi-connected space where every passage leads to new rooms, challenges, and discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room editor</strong>: Place and arrange rooms on a 2D slice of multidimensional space. Customize how rooms connect through passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickable items</strong>: Add objects that can be collected and interacted with during gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPCs</strong>: Place simple characters, adjust their poses, and create dialogue trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Event triggers</strong>: Define conditions that react to player actions and change the world state (e.g. opening doors, unlocking puzzles, or changing NPC behavior).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom assets</strong>: Upload your own .glb models to create new items or decorations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloud sharing</strong>: Publish your levels to the cloud, browse creations from other players, and download them directly in-game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features as the project grows:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More puzzle mechanics and interactive objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded NPC behaviors, quests, and character progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful customization tools for creating complete story-driven adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community hub for sharing, rating, and improving player-made content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your imagination is the main resource. Build connected spaces, design puzzles, create stories, and share them with others. If you enjoy <strong>creative freedom, puzzle-like exploration, and building games together with a community</strong>, this project is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in Early Access and help shape the future of the adventure builder.</p>",
